			<tr><td><img height="336" src="img/kyoryu02book.jpg" width="378" /></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">&nbsp;</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->
			<tr><th id="">ディスプレイポップ</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/kyoryu02019.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/kyoryu02019_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/ikimono_dispay/kyoryu02/img/kyoryu02019.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">&nbsp;</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->			
			<tr><th id="">恐竜01と02</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/kyoryu02021.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/kyoryu02021_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/ikimono_dispay/kyoryu02/img/kyoryu02021.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">これだけの数のしんぜんさんの恐竜が、一度に手に入る日が来るとは・・。<br />
				嬉しい限り。</td></tr>
